            "created_at": "2025-09-19T20:13:27.376822+00:00",
            "notes": "[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) At the top of the build I gave the numbers about why armor is so good, and this item is all we need to get armor wise. Depending on the matchup, for over half of your health bar, you could be taking 50% less damage, depending on the hero.\n- [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46): 25% less\n- [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768): 35% less\n- [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a): 50% less\n\nThe only time I would consider not taking it is if they have 2 heroes from [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b)[Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54)[Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05)[Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9), in which case [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) would probably be my blue survival item pick.\n\n[Pulse Detector](item_79ddef46-8917-4d8f-a123-7ddb589ad3e7) This is what we get as our damaging item this round, as it has a good secondary effect so your team just gets more info about who you are fighting or even where someone is. Ammo is also a really good stat on tracer and weapon power is just weapon power. We still need some.",
