            "notes": "[Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) is such a big boost to your consistency it can't be understated. If you never proc it, that's great, and if you do, you probably win the fight because of it, especially because it gives you all your blinks back. If it procs, just don't panic, and keep playing the fight normally to win. You will feel how good it is after only a few rounds of having the power.\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) By this round, you should expect chunks of armor on the enemy team, and Tracer needs this item to be any sort of effective against them. Since tracer does 50% less damage into armor, you effectively double your damage into it with this item. Not much else to say. \n\nAny extra cash should be spent on whatever blue weapon items you can afford, prioritizing [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2), [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f), and [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a).",
