            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) Boosts our survivability a lot, and our damage is already good, so this doesn't hurt us a lot in that stat. We can deal a lot of damage without taking too much poke, which lets us build up overhealth over the course of a fight very easily.\n\nAnd in the chance we do die even while being survivable, we have a whole second life to win the fight with.\n\nBesides this, just buy whatever weapon items make sense to you, and know that ammo is an excellent stat.",
